---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Skill Foundry"
  description="This page explains how Skill Foundry handles information when you use the website and its contact features."
  canonical="https://hub.skillfoundry-web.workers.dev/privacy/"
>
  <div class="legal-page">
    <section class="legal-hero">
      <div class="legal-container">
        <p class="legal-eyebrow">PRIVACY</p>
        <h1 class="legal-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-lead">This page explains how Skill Foundry handles information when you use the website and its contact features.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-body">
      <div class="legal-container">
        <div class="legal-content">
          <section class="legal-section-block">
            <h2>1. Information received through the website</h2>
            <p>Skill Foundry is currently a public educational resource website. The site does not require user accounts, registration, or payment details.</p>
            <p>If you choose to submit a message through the contact form, Skill Foundry receives the name, email address, subject, and message you provide. This information is used solely to respond to your enquiry, feedback, or report and is not published on the website.</p>
            <p>Like most web services, basic technical information handled by the hosting infrastructure may include standard server log details (such as IP addresses, browser type, and request timestamps) necessary to deliver, secure, and maintain the website.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section-block">
            <h2>2. Cookies and tracking</h2>
            <p>The website currently does not intentionally use advertising cookies or third-party tracking for personalized advertising. If analytics or data-collection features are added later, this policy will be updated to describe them.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section-block">
            <h2>3. External links</h2>
            <p>Resources and tutorials on Skill Foundry may link to third-party platforms, AI tools, and external services. Those services have their own privacy policies and practices outside Skill Foundry's control.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section-block legal-section-last">
            <h2>4. Updates</h2>
            <p>This policy may be updated when the website's data practices change, and the version published on this page applies to the current site.</p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    min-height: 80vh;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .legal-container {
    width: min(740px, calc(100% - 48px));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  /* 1. Hero Section */
  .legal-hero {
    padding: clamp(48px, 6vw, 72px) 0 clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 36px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line, #1E293B);
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 75% 20%, rgba(var(--accent-rgb, 245, 158, 11), 0.08), transparent 38%);
  }

  .legal-eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    color: var(--accent, #F59E0B);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .legal-title {
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    color: #F8FAFC;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5.5vw, 52px);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  .legal-lead {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 680px;
    color: #94A3B8;
    font-size: clamp(16px, 2.2vw, 17.5px);
    line-height: 1.62;
  }

  /* 2. Body Narrative Section */
  .legal-body {
    padding: 40px 0 64px;
  }

  .legal-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .legal-section-block h2 {
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    color: #F8FAFC;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 3vw, 24px);
    font-weight: 750;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .legal-section-block p {
    margin: 0 0 14px 0;
    color: #CBD5E1;
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.68;
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .legal-section-block p:last-of-type {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Light Theme Overrides */
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .legal-hero,
  :global(html.light-theme) .legal-hero {
    border-bottom-color: #E2E8F0;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 75% 20%, rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.06), transparent 38%);
  }
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .legal-title,
  :global(html.light-theme) .legal-title {
    color: #0F172A;
  }
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .legal-lead,
  :global(html.light-theme) .legal-lead {
    color: #475569;
  }
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .legal-section-block h2,
  :global(html.light-theme) .legal-section-block h2 {
    color: #0F172A;
  }
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .legal-section-block p,
  :global(html.light-theme) .legal-section-block p {
    color: #334155;
  }
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .legal-eyebrow,
  :global(html.light-theme) .legal-eyebrow {
    color: #D97706;
  }

  /* Mobile Responsive Rhythm */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .legal-container {
      width: min(740px, calc(100% - 32px));
    }

    .legal-hero {
      padding: 40px 0 24px;
    }

    .legal-body {
      padding: 28px 0 48px;
    }

    .legal-content {
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .legal-title {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .legal-section-block h2 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .legal-section-block p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
  }
</style>
